	(text "Package: 14 / 16 / 20 auto-detected\nVoltage: 3.3V / 5V / OFF auto-detected\n\nButton NEXT:\n    choose IC type\n\nButton TEST:\n    run selected test\nRGB LED states\nRed   = 14-pin mode\nGreen = 16-pin mode\nBlue  = 20-pin mode\n\nBlink = voltage OFF\nWhite flash = test running\nGreen blink = PASS\nRed blink = FAIL"
